{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":271706,"type":"movie"},"checkedAt":1793649425585,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":271706,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/271706","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T19:57:05.585Z","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","title":{"value":"Big Fish & Begonia","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"大鱼海棠","overview":{"value":"In un mondo non ancora visto da nessun umano in cui gli esseri viventi controllano il tempo, le maree e il mutare delle stagioni, la sedicenne Chun viene trasformata in un delfino per esplorare l'universo umano. Salvata da un vortice da un ragazzino a costo della sua stessa vita, Chun è così colpita dalla sua gentilezza da decidere di restituirgli la vita. Per farlo, però, si deve prendere cura dell'anima del ragazzo, materializzatasi in un piccolo pesce che andrà nutrito e cresciuto prima di essere liberato nuovamente.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Il sogno di una ragazza. Il destino di un uomo.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2016-07-08","status":"Released","rating":7.336,"ratingCount":504,"genres":["Animazione","Avventura","Fantasy"],"countries":["China","South Korea"],"facts":{"Runtime":"103m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1674211,"name":"Ji Guanlin","role":"Chun (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l0gh3dtxCloqdKZZ9NZnrm3kums.jpg"},{"id":1674212,"name":"Pan Shulan","role":"Old Chun (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxlQzgeyOxuQaZvq1NHxj9WWfdb.jpg"},{"id":1674213,"name":"Su Shangqing","role":"Qiu (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbTikaoO6lPtiHwJB1PzAqxYE27.jpg"},{"id":1591362,"name":"Timmy Xu","role":"Kun (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mntBCVt07NMqVafuBKOc9kCFl9U.jpg"},{"id":582557,"name":"King Shih-chieh","role":"Ling Po (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pQZBMC8ed97f5MNWb64SOlahxGs.jpg"},{"id":1674218,"name":"Jiu'er","role":"Kun's Sister (voice)"},{"id":1674219,"name":"Xang Yuanyuan","role":"Feng (voice)"},{"id":1674220,"name":"Xue Lifang","role":"Chun's Father (voice)"},{"id":1674221,"name":"Ajie","role":"Zi Chisong (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AaXR7HBOkyrLlM93cycAt6i9NDE.jpg"},{"id":3954698,"name":"Yang Ting","role":"Rat Woman (voice)"},{"id":1129530,"name":"Wang Deshun","role":"Pie (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yTmSmUH3CdEhU1zYd3maDg3ipBZ.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Big Fish & Begonia","overview":"In un mondo non ancora visto da nessun umano in cui gli esseri viventi controllano il tempo, le maree e il mutare delle stagioni, la sedicenne Chun viene trasformata in un delfino per esplorare l'universo umano. Salvata da un vortice da un ragazzino a costo della sua stessa vita, Chun è così colpita dalla sua gentilezza da decidere di restituirgli la vita. Per farlo, però, si deve prendere cura dell'anima del ragazzo, materializzatasi in un piccolo pesce che andrà nutrito e cresciuto prima di essere liberato nuovamente.","tagline":"Il sogno di una ragazza. Il destino di un uomo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Big Fish & Begonia","overview":"Beyond the human realm, there is a magical race of beings who control the tides and the changing of the seasons. One of these beings, a young girl named Chun, seeks something more—she wants to experience the human world! At sixteen, she finally gets her chance and transforms into a dolphin in order to explore the world that has her fascinated. But she soon discovers that it's a dangerous place and nearly gets killed in a vortex. Luckily, her life is spared when a young boy sacrifices himself to save her. Moved by his kindness and courage, she uses magic to bring him back to life only to learn that this power comes at a serious price. On a new adventure, she’ll have to make her own sacrifices in order to protect his soul until it is ready to return to the human world.","tagline":"Two worlds. One destiny."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"所有活着的人类，都是海里一条巨大的鱼；出生的时候他们从海的此岸出发。他们的生命就像横越大海，有时相遇，有时分开……死的时候，他们便到了岸，各去各的世界。  四十五亿年前，这个星球上，只有一片汪洋大海，和一群古老的大鱼。在与人类世界平行的空间里，生活着一个规规矩矩、遵守秩序的族群，他们为神工作，掌管世界万物运行规律，也掌管人类的灵魂。他们的天空与人类世界的大海相连。他们既不是神，也不是人，他们是“其他人”。  少女椿，作为生家族的继承人，掌管着海棠花的生长。不惜违背族人戒律，逆天而行，在海底世界秘密饲养人类少年的灵魂——一条拇指大的小鱼。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtHvNXgJWr58lpa2TDcDZS6lgm8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wtHvNXgJWr58lpa2TDcDZS6lgm8.png","language":"en","width":1276,"height":103},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UfMHHqwNBn3XH69ZoyoEIZeVeS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3UfMHHqwNBn3XH69ZoyoEIZeVeS.png","language":"zh","width":841,"height":220},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oyP785no5Z8GPz42BTQGTIHajTA.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oyP785no5Z8GPz42BTQGTIHajTA.png","language":"zh","width":1172,"height":470},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iQR8kkEYRk3OpUes06D4RuugWl1.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iQR8kkEYRk3OpUes06D4RuugWl1.png","language":"zh","width":924,"height":209}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ntLbnV4XsrE5sxuIkG76K2DykKO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ntLbnV4XsrE5sxuIkG76K2DykKO.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/daibt6Pvv5P0JzJgvHBXghYKMvX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/daibt6Pvv5P0JzJgvHBXghYKMvX.jpg","language":"it","width":639,"height":959},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRCdXh9MZutj1JJPZlUXMex6AuB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fRCdXh9MZutj1JJPZlUXMex6AuB.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/